#: ../../source/docs/modules/tuneopt.rst:9
#: 1ab8357e39534bff9310b14c2f583510
msgid "This module manages the action mapped to channel 6. It is used for multicopters only. Use ``tuneopt [set|show|reset|list]`` to manage the mapped action. For the ``set`` command, use the format ``tuneopt set [OPTION] [LOW] [HIGH]`` to map a tuning action and its range of values."
msgstr ""
